<title>RUSSIA: TSUM 96 H1 pre-tax profit 8.57 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>TSUM 96 H1 pre-tax profit 8.57 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian retailer TSUM had profit before tax of 8.57 billion roubles in the first half of this year after 21.14 billion roubles in the whole of 1995.</p>
<p>					 Jan-June 1996    Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Sales			   n/a		   53.46 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     8.96 bln rbls    18.74 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 8.57 bln rbls    21.14 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Net profit		    n/a		   13.47 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Capital and reserves	84.49 bln rbls    84.05 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Receivables		   10.35 bln rbls     4.23 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Accounts payable	    27.60 bln rbls    27.29 bln rbls</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name OAO Torgovy Dom TSUM. Figures to Russian accounting standards. Russian firm Aleks-Audit audited 1995 figures.</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
